payload/webos25-hdmi/  --  HDMI-input DTS passthrough opt-in (webOS 25, 5.4.268 kernels)
=====================================================================================

    earc_route-5.4.ko     from ../../../restore/kmod-out/ (committed; built by ../../../kmod/build.sh)
    earc-route-load.sh    from ../../../kmod/
    hdmi-watch.sh         from ../../../kmod/

The release workflow copies them here. Enable and the app's HDMI passthrough toggle
stage them to /var/lib/webosbrew/dts25/hdmi/, and the boot script runs hdmi-watch.sh
only while that opt-in is on. All three are GPL-2.0-only (../../../kmod/NOTICE,
../../licenses/NOTICE.md). They are not committed here (see ../../.gitignore).
